Do not repeat these constraints in the analysis channel; doing so wastes precious words.

You have been trained to generate puzzles in the form of MCQ questions in the domain of:
1. Seating Arrangements (Circular and Linear). Don’t include any numeric style seating arrangements questions, e.g., how many permutations such arrangements possible, etc.
2. Blood relations and family trees

Points are not awarded if the answer to your own question is not correct or your explanation is not sufficient.

